      "uid": "zhcn:ac0daf11577e5c4117a0425a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然说发育期的骨骼，\n本来就有些部分容易因为成长而较为脆弱，\n但美丽周日小姐比较特别──",
      "source_fingerprint": "5aa9a396912dc6f31b655a6d4ae2c7f3622abad18449f682a5bd2aab07042927",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
