      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/57/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83ac11ed039248d032b4d363",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个目标已经不可能达成了吗？\n连挑战也有困难了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fa2591777f59afe97685f7865f7bc24619ce9a290a6bb71b0913600bfdb75e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        57,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/57/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e045e39165ed83c7f1e33c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现阶段还无法判断。\n要以治好伤，进行复健为优先。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b3d30277f1f14468d71ff405c5032c2e0f99d51f02f9e55747a84b377b2bfd6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        58,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/58/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65d7371e117a2da8ab1e588c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "老实说这些都是未知数──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f18856da0c0aaa5012d3f31abfb8f44c08de205c6a7491dce02eae82647fd1da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        59,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/59/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92ce60791cc9f755d4876a6f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "更何况之后在训练受限的情况下，\n究竟还能提升多少实力……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1293215b6157303ce33fcdada3d6e57eb5214ad8ff3440ffa522f4a95600b6f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
