      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你，还有你☆一起唱吧──★\n大家一起唱最～美丽了☆★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "59cf39c2e6ac93ccc1f7c9f50d5105969361c6df8552504d927b51f36f06015f",
