    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14222649b33915b36aeb1ab1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然想在可承受范围内挑战比赛，就选\n她擅长的中距离吧。同时也得是适合当作\n今年一整年目标的年底重赏比赛──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f76064b0d87fa57a90665487d309c35f4603ef9db3ddf14fdd6138a700c38a9a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
